w('refusal.TEXT_CHAIN_COLLAPSED', 'This says the text came from a machine but not which one, or through how many hands. A scanned document can pass through a scanner, a reader and a clean-up pass before anyone sees it, and each one can change what it says — so the record keeps the whole sequence rather than a single word for it.', note='textchain, refusal by its code')
